n- The schema recommendation is documented and agreed with the Model Registry team,\n  and shared with the teams building the execution path, Dashboard views, and\n  Llama Stack provider\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-3 (defines the persisted, version-linked result format)\n- HLR-8 (defines the cost/duration metadata fields recorded per run)\n- Enables HLR-5 (Dashboard reads the schema) and HLR-7 (provider returns results\n  in the schema)\n\nAddresses the strategy's open question 2 (result schema).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":47231,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-be02543ae7df991c","agent_id":"aa255b350f855b6df","session_id":"a8243e44-1386-4db8-ba04-4dee4477cf9e","uuid":"b33f3e51-0ef0-412a-b5ff-16b463afd010","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:39:45.435Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9002 strategy"}
