e model\n  version it evaluated\n- Record cost/duration metadata per run (tokens, wall-clock, GPU time) for\n  capacity planning\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- An evaluation of a model served via a KServe endpoint or a Llama Stack\n  distribution can be launched against a selected suite and runs to completion\n  with per-benchmark scores\n- The service backs the Llama Stack eval provider API surface with the same\n  results as direct launches\n- Results are persisted and linked to the Model Registry model version of the\n  evaluated model, in the canonical result schema, and remain interpretable across\n  benchmark-suite version bumps\n- A user-defined custom evaluation task (own dataset and metrics) can be run\n  through the same flow as a standard suite\n- Each run records cost/duration metadata (tokens, wall-clock, GPU time)\n- The launch/status/results interface is available for the Dashboard, pipeline\n  step, and Llama Stack provider consumers\n- Selected out-of-the-box suites are available to the execution path (bundled or\n  customer-fetched per the licensing determination)\n- If the service lands in a new repository, its build pipeline is green before\n  this epic completes\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (execution backend for launching evaluations of served models)\n- HLR-3 (results persisted and linked to the Model Registry version)\n- HLR-4 (custom evaluation tasks through the same flow)\n- HLR-7 (service-side backing for the Llama Stack eval provider API)\n- HLR-8 (cost/duration metadata recording)\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":57659,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-be02543ae7df991c","agent_id":"aa255b350f855b6df","session_id":"a8243e44-1386-4db8-ba04-4dee4477cf9e","uuid":"4505d7ff-6a64-4503-842d-15be81bd3951","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:41:24.851Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9002 strate