irm the structure remains interpretable when a benchmark suite is upgraded\n47\t  (versioned suite identity recorded with results)\n48\t\n49\t## Acceptance Criteria\n50\t\n51\t- A prototype persists real MMLU evaluation results to a Model Registry model\n52\t  version's custom properties and reads them back correctly\n53\t- The schema records suite name and version so persisted results remain\n54\t  interpretable after a benchmark-suite version bump\n55\t- The schema carries the cost/duration metadata fields (tokens, wall-clock, GPU\n56\t  time) required for capacity planning\n57\t- The schema recommendation is documented and agreed with the Model Registry team,\n58\t  and shared with the teams building the execution path, Dashboard views, and\n59\t  Llama Stack provider\n60\t\n61\t## HLR Traceability\n62\t\n63\t- HLR-3 (defines the persisted, version-linked result format)\n64\t- HLR-8 (defines the cost/duration metadata fields recorded per run)\n65\t- Enables HLR-5 (Dashboard reads the schema) and HLR-7 (provider returns results\n66\t  in the schema)\n67\t\n68\tAddresses the strategy's open question 2 (result schema).\n69\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-86c22061e5140989","agent_id":"a48e50b94a679b3d6","session_id":"a8243e44-1386-4db8-ba04-4dee4477cf9e","uuid":"eb4c96a4-79eb-4746-80c6-e74747aaf55c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:44:40.172Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-84906aca1ed0903f","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9002 decomposition"}
