ific license terms cited\n49\t- Redistribution determinations are confirmed through legal review\n50\t- The final list of out-of-the-box (bundled) suites vs customer-fetched suites is\n51\t  produced and handed to the benchmark suite availability work as its input\n52\t\n53\t## HLR Traceability\n54\t\n55\t- HLR-2 (determines which standard suites can ship out of the box)\n56\t\n57\tAddresses the strategy's open question 3 (benchmark dataset licensing).\n58\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-86c22061e5140989","agent_id":"a48e50b94a679b3d6","session_id":"a8243e44-1386-4db8-ba04-4dee4477cf9e","uuid":"fcd579b5-86b7-41ba-b4fc-1e55507de292","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:44:41.445Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a5bb4fb794359415","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9002 decomposition"}
