{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-95e9e86fa145fdf5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9002-E006\n3\ttitle: Evaluation step in Data Science Pipelines\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9002\n5\tcomponent: Data Science Pipelines\n6\tteam: RHOAI Pipelines\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9002-E001\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9002-E001\n12\tgate_failure_impact:\n13\t  action: rewrite\n14\t  fallback_approach: If the execution-engine investigation selects a different execution\n15\t    path than assumed, the pipeline step is rewritten to launch evaluations through\n16\t    the selected interface; the KFP v2 component pattern stays the same.\n17\tai_signals:\n18\t  change_specificity: 0\n19\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n20\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n21\t  existing_foundation: 1\n22\t  open_questions: -1\n23\t  external_dependency: 0\n24\t  human_process_gates: 0\n25\t  repo_access: 1\n26\t  architecture_claims: 1\n27\timplementation_type: null\n28\tinvestigation_signals: null\n29\tai_implementability: High\n30\tai_implementability_score: 4\n31\tjira_key: null\n32\tbranch: null\n33\t---\n34\t# Evaluation step in Data Science Pipelines\n35\t\n36\t## Description\n37\t\n38\tEnables evaluations to be embedded as a step in a Data Science Pipeline, so\n39\tpromotion flows can gate on evaluation scores (humans make the promotion decision;\n40\tthe pipeline gates on the score). The step launches an evaluation through the\n41\tplatform's evaluation execution path and exposes the results as pipeline outputs.\n42\t\n43\t## Scope\n44\t\n45\t- A pipeline step/component that launches an evaluation of a served model against\n46\t  a selected benchmark suite through the platform evaluation capability\n47\t- Expose per-benchmark scores and pass/fail against configurable thresholds as\n48\t  step outputs, so downstream steps can gate on scores\n49\t- Consistent with the KFP v2 SDK component p