{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9136c40ba2094d3d","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9002-E004\n3\ttitle: Out-of-the-box standard benchmark suites\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9002\n5\tcomponent: TrustyAI\n6\tteam: TrustyAI\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9002-E003\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9002-E003\n12\tgate_failure_impact:\n13\t  action: rewrite\n14\t  fallback_approach: If licensing clears fewer suites than assumed for redistribution,\n15\t    the bundled catalog shrinks and the customer-fetched delivery mechanism carries\n16\t    more suites; the epic is rescoped to the confirmed redistributable set.\n17\tai_signals:\n18\t  change_specificity: 1\n19\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n20\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n21\t  existing_foundation: 1\n22\t  open_questions: 0\n23\t  external_dependency: 0\n24\t  human_process_gates: -1\n25\t  repo_access: 1\n26\t  architecture_claims: 1\n27\timplementation_type: null\n28\tinvestigation_signals: null\n29\tai_implementability: High\n30\tai_implementability_score: 4\n31\tjira_key: null\n32\tbranch: null\n33\t---\n34\t# Out-of-the-box standard benchmark suites\n35\t\n36\t## Description\n37\t\n38\tDelivers the standard benchmark suites out of the box so users can select them when\n39\tlaunching an evaluation, per the redistribution determinations from the benchmark\n40\tdataset licensing investigation. Suites are exposed through lm-eval task names,\n41\tconsistent with the platform's existing lm-evaluation-harness integration.\n42\t\n43\t## Scope\n44\t\n45\t- Package the suites determined redistributable (e.g. MMLU, ARC, HellaSwag exposed\n46\t  through lm-eval task names) for delivery with the platform, including\n47\t  disconnected (no external network) environments\n48\t- Provide the delivery mechanism for suites that cannot be redistributed, so\n49\t  customers can supply those datasets themselves and run them through the same\n50\t  flow\n51\t- Surface the suite catalog (suite name and version) for selection in the\n52\t  evaluation launch flow and for display of per-benchmark scores\n53\t- Record suite identity/version consistently so persisted results remain\n54\t  interpretable across suite version bumps\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- An evaluation can be launched against each bundled standard suite in a\n59\t  disconnected environment without external network access\n60\t- A customer-fetched suite can be supplied by the user and selected through the\n61\t  same launch flow as bundled suites\n62\t- The suite catalog identifies each suite's name and version, and only suites\n63\t  cleared for redistribution are bundled\n64\t- Each bundled suite's packaged version matches the suite identity recorded in\n65\t  persisted evaluation results\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- HLR-2 (primary — standard suites available out of the box)\n70\t- Supports HLR-1 (launch against a selected benchmark suite)\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ab900bb5d18f93ef","agent_id":"a404d519e095e1902","session_id":"a8243e44-1386-4db8-ba04-4dee4477cf9e","uuid":"fcf7d02d-a550-4443-b650-e966cb775b97","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:57:48.069Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9136c40ba2094d3d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9002 decomposition"}
