\n50\t  model served on the platform (KServe endpoint or Llama Stack distribution) with\n51\t  a selected benchmark suite (standard out-of-the-box or user-defined custom task)\n52\t- Expose the launch/status/results interface that the Dashboard, the Data Science\n53\t  Pipelines evaluation step, and the Llama Stack eval provider build against\n54\t- Persist evaluation results to Model Registry custom properties on the evaluated\n55\t  model's version, in the canonical result schema, linking each run to the model\n56\t  version it evaluated\n57\t- Support user-defined custom evaluation tasks (own datasets and metrics) through\n58\t  the same launch flow as standard suites\n59\t- Record cost/duration metadata per run (tokens, wall-clock, GPU time) for\n60\t  capacity planning\n61\t\n62\t## Acceptance Criteria\n63\t\n64\t- An evaluation of a model served via a KServe endpoint or a Llama Stack\n65\t  distribution can be launched against a selected suite and runs to completion\n66\t  with per-benchmark scores\n67\t- Results are persisted and linked to the Model Registry model version of the\n68\t  evaluated model, in the canonical result schema, and remain interpretable across\n69\t  benchmark-suite version bumps\n70\t- A user-defined custom evaluation task (own dataset and metrics) can be run\n71\t  through the same flow as a standard suite\n72\t- Each run records cost/duration metadata (tokens, wall-clock, GPU time)\n73\t- The launch/status/results interface is available for the Dashboard, pipeline\n74\t  step, and Llama Stack provider consumers\n75\t- Selected out-of-the-box suites are available to the execution path (bundled or\n76\t  customer-fetched per the licensing determination)\n77\t\n78\t## HLR Traceability\n79\t\n80\t- HLR-1 (execution backend for launching evaluations of served models)\n81\t- HLR-3 (results persisted and linked to the Model Registry version)\n82\t- HLR-4 (custom evaluation tasks through the same flow)\n83\t- HLR-8 (cost/duration metadata recording)\n84\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ab900bb5d18f93ef","agent_id":"a404d519e095e1902","session_id":"a8243e44-1386-4db8-ba04-4dee4477cf9e","uuid":"14fc79d4-3a19-4b0b-add4-926d9d1936c0","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:57:58.923Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-ad14cc68a069a3bf","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9002 decomposition"}
